    "detailed_description": "You control a space station in the form of a cube that protects the planet from invaders. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe cube consists of towers of different colors, the ships of the invaders are also of different colors, you must turn the sides of the cube so that the color of the tower matches the color of the invader's ship, until you do this the ship will attack the cube and take life from it. As soon as life is over you will lose.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter the color matches, the tower will fire and destroy the ship.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHold out for as long as possible and get points for it, become the leader of the game on the leaderboard.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you make all sides of the same color, you will automatically win with 9999 points.",
